Comment:
 Halcyon is written from published specifications: the TCI Protocol 2.1
 document (ExpertSDR3/TCI) for the TCI framing, the Hermes-Lite 2 protocol
 pages for HPSDR Protocol 1, and the openHPSDR discovery and start/stop
 packets.  No third-party source code is included and none was copied in.
 CREDITS.md lists the protocol documents, the reference programs whose
 behaviour compatibility was checked against, and the libraries used.
